{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12231050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12231050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1223105001:0":{"text":"내 물건... 내 물건! 으윽, 전부 땅에 떨어졌으니 이젠 팔지도 못하게 됐네!","source_cn":"我的货……我的货！喔唷，全都掉到地上了！这下卖不出去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9A11A3A3569C21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223105002:0":{"text":"어이, 망할 물귀신들! 일부러 그런 거지?!","source_cn":"喂！肮脏的水鬼，你们故意的是不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x998BA57E8BF811CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223105003:0":{"text":"일자리를 준 은혜를 감히 이따위로 갚아?!","source_cn":"我大发慈悲给你们工作的机会，你们就是这样回报我的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE485C1213FF19753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223105004:0":{"text":"이봐, 사장. 오해야! 전부 블러디 로즈 탓이라고! 아니었으면 물건이 망가질 일도 없었는데!","source_cn":"这是误会，老板。都怪血薇帮，不然货也不会弄脏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA459DFF068129D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223105005:0":{"text":"오해? 그래! 내가 너희들이 돈도 안 걷고 진짜 마음을 고쳐먹었나 오해했지! 물건들을 제대로 목적지까지 배달할 수 있을 거라고 오해했던 거야!","source_cn":"误会？是啊！我误认为你们不收钱，是真的想改过自新！能把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9241ED9AA4FD1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223105006:1":{"text":"에휴, 재수가 없으려고! 물귀신이 마음을 고쳐먹을 수 있다고 생각한 내 잘못이지!","source_cn":"唉，算我倒霉！就不该相信水鬼还能改过自新！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE11775760398086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223105007:0":{"text":"잠깐... 물귀신파를 고용한 건가?","source_cn":"等一下，你雇佣了水鬼帮？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DDB88F1704397E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223105008:0":{"text":"그래, 그게 뭐?","source_cn":"是啊，怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCDEDAA3356C600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223105009:1":{"text":"뭐? 그러니까... 강도질이 아니었다고?","source_cn":"什么！他们不是在打劫吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D49CE9BD8CF65AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223105010:0":{"text":"강도질은 무슨! 내가 옮기라고 시킨 내 물건인데! ","source_cn":"这是我的货，我让他们搬的！打什么劫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EC8430A5270D3F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223105011:0":{"text":"재수도 없지. 제대로 물건만 옮기려고 했는데, 강도 취급이나 당하다니...","source_cn":"真倒霉，好不容易良心发现想送个货，居然也被当做打劫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4419A85F68213223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223105012:0":{"text":"블러디 로즈 탓을 할 일은 아니에요. 당신들이 나타날 때마다 항상 강도질했으니, 당연히 그렇게 생각하죠.","source_cn":"这也不能怪血薇帮吧，谁让你们一出现就是抢这抢那的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C4FF9CCA024E352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223105013:0":{"text":"당신들은 이미 러스트 항의 트라우마란 말이에요. 안 무서워하는 게 이상하지 않아요?","source_cn":"你们都已经成为锈锚港的阴影了！谁看到你们不害怕呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC717C146D9602A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1223105014:0":{"text":"네 말이 맞아. 우리보고 일자리를 찾아보라고 했던 아르의 생각은 정말 최악이었어!","source_cn":"你说的没错，阿尔让我们来找活干的主意真是糟透了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BEE92B95322E8A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1223105015:1":{"text":"이봐! 내 물건이 아직 땅에 널려 있다고!! ","source_cn":"喂喂喂！我的货还在地上呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE3F038EB17971D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223105016:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD313E95269D44AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","variant_male_record_index":"139695","variant_female_record_index":"139696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1223105016":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，您能帮忙吗？这些混蛋太让人不放心了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD313E95269D44AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 도와주실 수 있을까요? 이 녀석들은 도저히 믿을 수가 없어서요.","variant_male_record_index":"139695","variant_female_record_index":"139696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223105017:0":{"text":"크흠, 그럼 우리도 정리하는 걸 도와주도록 하지.","source_cn":"咳咳，我们也来帮忙收拾吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72C93C17E4F1EF9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1223105018:0":{"text":"네, 타인을 돕는 건 기사의 미덕이니까요!","source_cn":"嗯，骑士有帮助人的美德！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02638D2FD15EA2D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1223105019:0":{"text":"고맙습니다. 원래대로만 해주면 돼요. 물건 망가진 건 그냥 제가 재수 없어서 그런 거라고 생각하면 되겠죠. 에휴...","source_cn":"太感谢了，只要恢复原样就好，要是有货损我就自认倒霉了，唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2380E0719A91BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"녹스를 바라본다","source_cn":"看向诺克","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57A228F11EEFEBBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"녹스를 바라본다","female":"녹스를 바라본다","variant_male_record_index":"67518","variant_female_record_index":"67519","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:1:2":{"text":"도와주려면 끝까지 도와줘야지","source_cn":"好人做到底","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8E00A9CF596E383D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도와주려면 끝까지 도와줘야지","female":"도와주려면 끝까지 도와줘야지","variant_male_record_index":"67520","variant_female_record_index":"67521","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的雇主":{"text":"분노한 고용주","source":"愤怒的雇主","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮西索":{"text":"세실","source":"水鬼帮西索","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮诺克":{"text":"녹스","source":"血薇帮诺克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":4}}